        "original_id": "2df4ca4f-0b6c-5f2b-8ecf-c47c15c6bc2b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Charlie Rowe, Philip Pullman, Octavia Spencer, Dave Annable\n- Works: Never Let Me Go, The Boat That Rocked, The Golden Compass, Neverland, Red Band Society, Northern Lights, His Dark Materials\n- Organizations: Fox, SyFy, Sky Movies\n\nFacts:\n- The Golden Compass is a 2007 British-American fantasy adventure film.\n- The Golden Compass is based on Northern Lights, the first novel in Philip Pullman's His Dark Materials trilogy.\n- Charlie Rowe played Billy Costa in The Golden Compass.\n- Charlie Rowe played James in The Boat That Rocked.\n- Charlie Rowe played Young Tommy in Never Let Me Go.\n- Charlie Rowe played Peter in Neverland, a Peter Pan prequel produced for SyFy and Sky Movies.\n- Charlie Rowe recently played Leo Roth in the Fox medical comedy-drama series Red Band Society.\n- Charlie Rowe appeared in Red Band Society alongside Octavia Spencer and Dave Annable.",
